OL,3,GNEWSAMan who stabbed housemate guilty
OL,4,Aof murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who stabbed his housemate
OL,7,Fmultiple times then went shopping for
OL,8,Falcohol has been found guilty of
OL,9,Fmurder.
OL,11,FMark Carpenter, 51, of Embankment Road,
OL,12,FPlymouth, was convicted of murdering
OL,13,FHarry Jackson by a jury at Plymouth
OL,14,FCrown Court.
OL,16,FThe court heard police were called to a
OL,17,Fshared house at 20:22 on 4 May 2026
OL,18,Fafter another resident found Jackson's
OL,19,Fbody at the bottom of the stairs.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
